{"unit":4,"no":13,"title":"My perfect neighbourhood","blurb":"Unit 4","VOCAB":[["airport","","аэропорт","әуежай",""],["library","","библиотека","кітапхана",""],["campsite","","кемпинг","кемпинг",""],["museum","","музей","мұражай",""],["chemist","","аптека","дәріхана",""],["railway station","","ж/д вокзал","теміржол вокзалы",""],["hairdresser's","","парикмахерская","шаштараз",""],["swimming pool","","бассейн","бассейн",""],["hotel","","отель","қонақ үй",""],["theatre","","театр","театр",""],["neighbourhood","","район","шағын аудан",""],["quiet","","тихий","тыныш",""],["noisy","","шумный","шулы",""],["modern","","современный","заманауи",""],["safe","","безопасный","қауіпсіз",""]],"SLIDES":[["🌳","There's a park near my house."]],"PICWORDS":["airport","library","campsite","museum","chemist","railway station","hairdresser's","swimming pool","hotel","theatre","neighbourhood","quiet","noisy","modern","safe"],"DEFS":[],"CTX":{},"COLLOC":{},"IMG":{},"NOTES":{},"TIMING":{},"tracks":{"4_1":"A1_L13_4_1.mp3","4_13":"A1_L13_4_13.mp3","4_3":"A1_L13_4_3.mp3","4_12":"A1_L13_4_12.mp3"},"SEGS":{"4_1":[3.26,null],"4_13":[3.45,null],"4_3":[3.25,null],"4_12":[3.64,null]},"html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Intro\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 1 &middot; Intro</div>\n      <h2>My perfect neighbourhood</h2>\n      <p>Describe a town or an area: what it has, what it doesn't have, what it's like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How to study</b> — about 25 minutes, top to bottom.</div><div>Headphones on. This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen.</div><div>After each <b>Check answers</b>, read the note — that is your teacher.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How this lesson works</b> — you work with a partner. Say your answers out loud.</div><div>This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen together.</div><div>Check your answers after each task.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How this lesson works</b> — you work with your teacher. Say your answers out loud.</div><div>This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen together.</div><div>Check your answers after each task.</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Warm-up\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 2 &middot; Warm-up</div>\n      <h2>Warm-up</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">What is near your home?</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Tap everything within ten minutes on foot.</p>\n      <div class=\"grid3\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><div class=\"card\"><b>🌳</b> &nbsp;a park</div><div class=\"card\"><b>☕</b> &nbsp;a café</div><div class=\"card\"><b>📚</b> &nbsp;a library</div><div class=\"card\"><b>💊</b> &nbsp;a chemist</div><div class=\"card\"><b>🏊</b> &nbsp;a swimming pool</div><div class=\"card\"><b>🚉</b> &nbsp;a station</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Words\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 3 &middot; Words</div>\n      <h2>Words</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"vbar\">\n        <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin:0\">Read the words. Click a card to see an example.</div>\n        <label class=\"switch\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"trToggle\"><span class=\"track\"></span><span>Show translation</span></label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"words\" id=\"words\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">These are your place words for this lesson.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Tap 🔊 to listen. Turn on translations only if you need them.</p>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('4_1',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 4.1 — places in a town</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">airport · campsite · chemist · hairdresser's · hospital · hotel · library · museum · railway station · restaurant · swimming pool · theatre</div></details>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Recall\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 4 &middot; Recall</div>\n      <h2>Recall</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('4_13',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 4.13 — seven place riddles</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">1 You go here when you are ill. 2 You can study here or take books home. 3 You can see a film here. 4 You usually need your passport to travel from here. 5 You can sleep here on holiday. 6 You can go here to have dinner. 7 There's lots of water and you can swim here.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"self\">Listen to the riddles. Choose the place.</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l13s3SSt3\" data-only=\"self\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">1 — You go here when you are ill.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a hospital</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a library</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">an hospital</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">2 — You can study here or take books home.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a library</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a theatre</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">an library</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">4 — You need your passport to travel from here.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a campsite</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">an airport</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">a airport</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">5 — You can sleep here on holiday.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a museum</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">an museum</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">a hotel</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">7 — Lots of water — you can swim here.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a swimming pool</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a chemist</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">an swimming pool</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>hospital · library · airport · hotel · swimming pool.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"group\">Listen to the riddles. Then match each riddle to its place.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\">Tap a riddle, then tap the place.</p>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\"><b>Riddle</b> &rarr; <b>Place</b></p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l13s3GRt5\" data-only=\"group\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\"><b>you are ill</b> <select data-answer=\"a hospital\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"a hospital\">a hospital</option><option value=\"a library\">a library</option><option value=\"an airport\">an airport</option><option value=\"a hotel\">a hotel</option><option value=\"a restaurant\">a restaurant</option><option value=\"a swimming pool\">a swimming pool</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\"><b>books to take home</b> <select data-answer=\"a library\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"a hospital\">a hospital</option><option value=\"a library\">a library</option><option value=\"an airport\">an airport</option><option value=\"a hotel\">a hotel</option><option value=\"a restaurant\">a restaurant</option><option value=\"a swimming pool\">a swimming pool</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\"><b>your passport, please</b> <select data-answer=\"an airport\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"a hospital\">a hospital</option><option value=\"a library\">a library</option><option value=\"an airport\">an airport</option><option value=\"a hotel\">a hotel</option><option value=\"a restaurant\">a restaurant</option><option value=\"a swimming pool\">a swimming pool</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\"><b>sleep on holiday</b> <select data-answer=\"a hotel\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"a hospital\">a hospital</option><option value=\"a library\">a library</option><option value=\"an airport\">an airport</option><option value=\"a hotel\">a hotel</option><option value=\"a restaurant\">a restaurant</option><option value=\"a swimming pool\">a swimming pool</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\"><b>dinner for two</b> <select data-answer=\"a restaurant\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"a hospital\">a hospital</option><option value=\"a library\">a library</option><option value=\"an airport\">an airport</option><option value=\"a hotel\">a hotel</option><option value=\"a restaurant\">a restaurant</option><option value=\"a swimming pool\">a swimming pool</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\"><b>water — swim!</b> <select data-answer=\"a swimming pool\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"a hospital\">a hospital</option><option value=\"a library\">a library</option><option value=\"an airport\">an airport</option><option value=\"a hotel\">a hotel</option><option value=\"a restaurant\">a restaurant</option><option value=\"a swimming pool\">a swimming pool</option></select></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"solo\">Listen to the riddles. Then match each riddle to its place.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\">Tap a riddle, then tap the place.</p>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\"><b>Riddle</b> &rarr; <b>Place</b></p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l13s3OOt7\" data-only=\"solo\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\"><b>you are ill</b> <select data-answer=\"a hospital\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"a hospital\">a hospital</option><option value=\"a library\">a library</option><option value=\"an airport\">an airport</option><option value=\"a hotel\">a hotel</option><option value=\"a restaurant\">a restaurant</option><option value=\"a swimming pool\">a swimming pool</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\"><b>books to take home</b> <select data-answer=\"a library\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"a hospital\">a hospital</option><option value=\"a library\">a library</option><option value=\"an airport\">an airport</option><option value=\"a hotel\">a hotel</option><option value=\"a restaurant\">a restaurant</option><option value=\"a swimming pool\">a swimming pool</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\"><b>your passport, please</b> <select data-answer=\"an airport\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"a hospital\">a hospital</option><option value=\"a library\">a library</option><option value=\"an airport\">an airport</option><option value=\"a hotel\">a hotel</option><option value=\"a restaurant\">a restaurant</option><option value=\"a swimming pool\">a swimming pool</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\"><b>sleep on holiday</b> <select data-answer=\"a hotel\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"a hospital\">a hospital</option><option value=\"a library\">a library</option><option value=\"an airport\">an airport</option><option value=\"a hotel\">a hotel</option><option value=\"a restaurant\">a restaurant</option><option value=\"a swimming pool\">a swimming pool</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\"><b>dinner for two</b> <select data-answer=\"a restaurant\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"a hospital\">a hospital</option><option value=\"a library\">a library</option><option value=\"an airport\">an airport</option><option value=\"a hotel\">a hotel</option><option value=\"a restaurant\">a restaurant</option><option value=\"a swimming pool\">a swimming pool</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\"><b>water — swim!</b> <select data-answer=\"a swimming pool\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"a hospital\">a hospital</option><option value=\"a library\">a library</option><option value=\"an airport\">an airport</option><option value=\"a hotel\">a hotel</option><option value=\"a restaurant\">a restaurant</option><option value=\"a swimming pool\">a swimming pool</option></select></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Grammar\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 5 &middot; Grammar</div>\n      <h2>Grammar</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">There is / There are — what a place has.</div>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('4_3',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 4.3 — three questions about the town</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">1 Is there a swimming pool? — No, I'm sorry, there isn't. It doesn't rain a lot here, so there aren't many swimming pools. 2 Are there any museums near the centre? — Yes, there are. There's the opal mine museum. 3 Is there a theatre in Coober Pedy? — No, there aren't any theatres here.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l13s4t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Is there a swimming pool?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Yes, there is.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Yes, there are.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">No, there isn't.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Are there any museums near the centre?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">No, there aren't.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Yes, there are.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">No, there isn't.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Is there a theatre?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Yes, there's one theatre.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Yes, there've one theatre.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">No, there aren't any theatres.</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>No pool · yes — the opal mine museum · no theatres.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div>“<b>There's</b> a big swimming pool in the town centre.”</div><div>“<b>There are some</b> nice restaurants.”</div><div>“<b>There aren't any</b> theatres here.”</div><div>“<b>Is there</b> a school?” — “Yes, <b>there is</b>.”</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">Notice</div><p><span class=\"q\">Notice:</span> when do we say <b>there is</b> — and when <b>there are</b>?</p></div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:18px;overflow-x:auto\"><table class=\"gtable\"><tbody><tr><th>Form</th><th>One thing</th><th>More than one</th></tr><tr><td>Positive</td><td class=\"pos\">There<b>'s</b> a park.</td><td>There <b>are some</b> cafés. · There are <b>a lot of</b> shops.</td></tr><tr><td>Negative</td><td class=\"pos\">There <b>isn't a</b> hotel.</td><td>There <b>aren't any</b> museums.</td></tr><tr><td>Question</td><td class=\"pos\"><b>Is there a</b> school? — Yes, there is.</td><td><b>Are there any</b> shops? — No, there aren't.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div>One thing → <b>there is (there's) a…</b> · More than one → <b>there are</b>.</div><div><b>some</b> in positive sentences: there are some cafés. <b>any</b> in negatives and questions: there aren't any shops · Are there any banks?</div><div><b>a lot of</b> = many: there are a lot of cars.</div><div>Short answers: Yes, there is. / No, there aren't.</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Practice\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 6 &middot; Practice</div>\n      <h2>Practice</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Part 1 — there is or there are? some or any?</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l13s5t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">___ a chemist on the corner.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">There are</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">It is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">There's</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">___ two parks in my neighbourhood.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">There are</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">There is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">There iss</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">There are ___ nice cafés near here.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">any</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">some</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">a</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">There aren't ___ theatres in my town.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">some</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">any</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">Are there ___ museums near the centre?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">some</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">any</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">There are ___ cars in my street — it's very noisy.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a lot of</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">an lot of</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>One → there's a. Plural → there are. Positive → <b>some</b>. Negative/question → <b>any</b>. Many → <b>a lot of</b>.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l13s5t2\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “There is many cafés here.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">There is a lot of café here.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">There are a lot of cafés here.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">There is a lot of cafés here.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “Are there a school near here?”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Is there a school near here?</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Are there any school near here?</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Is there an school near here?</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “There aren't some shops.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">There isn't some shops.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">There aren't any shops.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">There aren't no shops.</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Plural → there <b>are a lot of</b> · one thing → <b>Is there a</b> · negative → <b>any</b>.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l13s5t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">There are three ___ in the centre. <span class='cue'>(library)</span>\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">librarys</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">libraries</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">want</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">People ___ a quiet street. <span class='cue'>(want)</span>\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">want</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">wants</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">wanting</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">My street ___ very noisy at night. <span class='cue'>(be)</span>\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">are</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">am</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>librar<b>ies</b> · people <b>want</b> (plural) · my street <b>is</b>.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Read\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 7 &middot; Read</div>\n      <h2>Read</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">What does a perfect neighbourhood need — and where is the strangest one?</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l13s6t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">The text is about…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">how to buy a flat.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">the biggest cities in the world.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">what people want in an area — and one very unusual town.</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>First the perfect neighbourhood — then the strangest one.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l13s6t2\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">A park is at the top of the list.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">False</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">True</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">A swimming pool is more important than a cinema.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">True</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">False</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Neft Dashlari is a town on an oil platform.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">True</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">False</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">There are a lot of tourists in Neft Dashlari.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">False</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">True</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">There's a school there, but there isn't a university.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">True</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">False</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>The cinema wins(!). Neft Dashlari: a school yes, a university no — and <b>no tourists</b>.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l13s6t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">“There ___ always cafés and a library.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">am</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">are</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">“There ___ any tourists.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">isn't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">don't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">aren't</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Find the word that means “an area of a town where people live”.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">neighbourhood</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">platform</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">corner</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>cafés (plural) → <b>are</b> · tourists → <b>aren't any</b> · <b>neighbourhood</b>.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">Notice</div><p><span class=\"q\">Before you read:</span> what is number one for you — a park, a café or a supermarket?</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Listen\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 8 &middot; Listen</div>\n      <h2>Listen</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Neft Dashlari — the town in the Caspian Sea.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Listen once. Then choose the correct answers.</p>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('4_12',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 4.12 — the town on the oil platform</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">A: What's special about Neft Dashlari? B: It's a town on an oil platform in the Caspian Sea. A: A town in the sea? Is it very small? B: No, not really. There are 300 km of streets and 2,000 people. And there are lots of things to do. A: Really? Are there any restaurants? B: Of course! There are some nice restaurants and hotels, and there's a cinema and a park, too. A: What about education? Is there a school? B: Yes, there's a school, but there isn't a university. A: So can people visit the place? B: No, there aren't any tourists. Only people who work on Neft Dashlari can go there.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l13s7t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">How many people live there?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">2,000</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">300</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">20,000</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Are there any restaurants?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Yes — some nice restaurants and hotels.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">No, there aren't.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">2,000</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Who can go to Neft Dashlari?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Anyone with a ticket</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Only people who work there</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Only tourists</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>2,000 people · restaurants, hotels, a cinema and a park · only <b>workers</b> can go.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Write\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 9 &middot; Write</div>\n      <h2>Write</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"self\">Write about the area of your dreams.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"self\">5–6 sentences with there is / there are, some / any.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>In my perfect neighbourhood there's…</li><li>There are some…</li><li>There are a lot of…</li><li>There isn't a…</li><li>There aren't any…</li><li>It's quiet / safe / modern.</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"group\">Design the perfect neighbourhood — together.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\">Agree on five places. Then present your area to another pair.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>In our neighbourhood there's…</li><li>There are some…</li><li>There aren't any…</li><li>Is there a…?</li><li>Are there any…?</li><li>It's quiet / safe / modern.</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"solo\">Design the perfect neighbourhood — together.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\">Agree on five places. Then present your area to your teacher.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>In our neighbourhood there's…</li><li>There are some…</li><li>There aren't any…</li><li>Is there a…?</li><li>Are there any…?</li><li>It's quiet / safe / modern.</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>Step 1</b> — you can build only FIVE places in your new area. Agree together: a park? a pool? a cinema?</div><div><b>Step 2</b> — decide what there ISN'T in your area — and why.</div><div><b>Step 3</b> — present to another pair: “In our neighbourhood there's… There are some… There aren't any…” They ask two Is there…? questions.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>Step 1</b> — you can build only FIVE places in your new area. Agree together: a park? a pool? a cinema?</div><div><b>Step 2</b> — decide what there ISN'T in your area — and why.</div><div><b>Step 3</b> — present to your teacher: “In our neighbourhood there's… There are some… There aren't any…” They ask two Is there…? questions.</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Type it\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 10 &middot; Type it</div>\n      <h2>Type it</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Now produce it — type, don’t tap.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Spelling counts. Type the answers, then check.</p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l13s9t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">___ two caf\\u00e9s on my street.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"There are\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">___ a park near here.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"There's|There is\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Are there ___ shops? \\u2014 No.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"any\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>there is + one \\u00b7 there are + many \\u00b7 negative/question use any.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l13s9t2\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">There is many caf\\u00e9s.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"There are many caf\\u00e9s.\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">There aren't a park.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"There isn't a park.\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Is there any shops?<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Are there any shops?\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>there is + one \\u00b7 there are + many \\u00b7 negative/question use any.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l13s9t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Make it negative: There are some shops.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"There aren't any shops.\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Make a question: There is a bank near here.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Is there a bank near here?\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Change to TWO: There is a caf\\u00e9.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"There are two caf\\u00e9s.\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>there is + one \\u00b7 there are + many \\u00b7 negative/question use any.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Done\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 11 &middot; Done</div>\n      <h2>Done</h2>\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n"}